type: software
title: "Supplementary materials for: Recursive Training on Model-Generated Data"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-02"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Jazancort/cosrev-recursive-training-replication"
abstract: >
  Supplementary code, data and pre-compiled PDFs for the integrative review
  "Recursive Training on Model-Generated Data: A Critical Integrative Review of
  Failure Regimes, Adversarial Interactions and Governance" (Computer Science
  Review, 2026, COSREV-D-26-01510). Includes S1 (cited sources table), S2 (search
  protocol), S3 (theorem cards), S4 (numerical checks), simulation scripts,
  search log and verification scripts.

